        "$comment_diff_filter": "仅返回与 catalog 存在差异的 model：local_input_price/local_output_price != catalog_input_price/catalog_output_price，或 catalog_deprecation_date != null。无差异时返回 {data: [], total: 0}。",
        "response_status": [200, 401, 500],
        "response_envelope": "{ data: DiffItem[], total: number }",
        "response_item_fields": [
          "model_id", "model_name", "catalog_id", "catalog_source_model_id",
          "local_input_price", "local_output_price",
          "catalog_input_price", "catalog_output_price",
          "is_overridden", "input_delta_pct", "output_delta_pct",
          "catalog_deprecation_date"
        ],
        "error_codes": {
          "500": "internal_error/internal_error"
        }
      },
      {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/api/v1/model-catalog/apply-diff",
        "auth": "admin",
        "handler": "CatalogHandler.ApplyDiff",
        "input_struct": "inline {ModelIDs []string}",
        "request_fields_required": ["model_ids"],
        "request_fields_optional": [],
        "request_field_constraints": {
          "model_ids": "required,min=1,dive,uuid"
        },
        "$comment_semantics": "对 request 中指定的 model（必须已绑定 catalog）批量从 catalog 重拉 input_price / output_price，清除对应 override 标志。已被显式 override 且不在 model_ids 中的不会被覆盖。response.failed_ids 列举因 catalog_not_found / catalog_not_bound 等原因跳过的 id。",
        "response_status": [200, 400, 401, 404, 500],
        "response_envelope": "success_single",
        "response_item_fields": ["updated", "skipped", "failed_ids"],
        "error_codes": {
          "400": "invalid_request/bad_request OR invalid_request/invalid_model_id",
          "404": "not_found/model_not_found",
          "500": "internal_error/internal_error"
        }
      }
